@startuml Lihat_Laporan_Admin
!theme plain
title SD: Lihat Laporan (Admin)
actor Admin
participant "App (Flutter)" as App
participant "Backend" as API
database "Database" as DB

Admin -> App: Buka Menu Laporan
App -> API: GET /reports
API -> DB: SELECT orders\nLEFT JOIN users\nORDER BY id DESC
DB --> API: List transaksi\n(id, nama, total, status, tanggal, online/offline)
API --> App: JSON laporan
App --> Admin: Tampil tabel laporan\n(Online & Offline/Kasir)

Admin -> App: Klik "Cetak PDF"
App -> App: Generate PDF dari data laporan
App --> Admin: Share / simpan PDF

@enduml
